    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Eoin O’Neill Property Advisers are pleased to present this A-rated two-bedroom duplex in Stockwell. Positioned within a small development of just eight properties off Sandyford Road, the property offers generously proportioned, light-filled accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hallway with a large storage cupboard, a well-proportioned modern kitchen to the front with built-in appliances and ample storage, and a spacious living/dining room to the rear. Upstairs are two spacious double bedrooms, both with built-in wardrobes. The main bedroom further benefits from an en-suite bathroom. A second bathroom and additional storage room complete the internal accommodation, with the main bathroom comprising a bath, shower, WC and WHB. The property also benefits from a south-facing balcony to the front.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include an A-rated BER, air-to-water heating and one designated parking space. Stockwell is ideally situated close to Dundrum Village, Sandyford Village, Dundrum Town Centre, The Beacon Hospital and Sandyford Business District, offering a wide selection of shops, cafés and restaurants. There are also a variety of recreational amenities nearby, including Ballawley Park and Marlay Park. Transport links are excellent, with a number of bus routes in the area and the Green LUAS providing convenient access to Dublin city centre and further afield. The property is also conveniently located for the M50.\r\n\r\nEmail enquiries only. Please include full details when enquiring. Due to the expected high level of interest, it may not be possible to respond to all enquiries."
      },
